#Week 3: Password Hashing and Cracking

 ##Project Overview

This project documents my Week 3 practical cybersecurity exercise, which focused on password hashing, hash calculation, and password cracking.

The exercise provided hands-on experience with password-related security tools, helping me understand how password hashes are generated, how they can be analysed, and how password-cracking tools are used to test the strength of passwords.

The tools explored during this exercise included John the Ripper (JTR), Networkwalks Hash Calculator, and Networkwalks Password Cracker.
